{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "nwrmpxtc6pr5bgs9", "title": "102.PEFT参数高效微调", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u04f8dcae\" id=\"u04f8dcae\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u35e79420\" id=\"u35e79420\">示例代码</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4934ba46\" id=\"u4934ba46\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"file\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fppt%2F2424104%2F1745804257867-6539deb1-815d-474c-8a74-d236f3f9f72a.ppt%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22peft-demo.ppt%22%2C%22size%22%3A1147%2C%22ext%22%3A%22ppt%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ud925d7b5-ba64-4ad5-a276-11512a4bf2f%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fvnd.ms-powerpoint%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ubd33c1fa%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubd00ce8d\" id=\"ubd00ce8d\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u9fb7d65d\" id=\"u9fb7d65d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">注：将ppt后缀名改为zip后解压</span></em></p><p data-lake-id=\"u45cf2a03\" id=\"u45cf2a03\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue444796e\" id=\"ue444796e\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u59086b59\" id=\"u59086b59\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/blog/peft\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u9ec7edc9\" id=\"u9ec7edc9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u260870ff\" id=\"u260870ff\">参数高效微调（PEFT）方法</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u6c420d06\" id=\"u6c420d06\">在微调过程中冻结预训练模型的参数，并在其顶部添加少量可训练参数（adapters）。adapters 被训练以学习特定任务的信息。这种方法已被证明非常节省内存，同时具有较低的计算使用量，同时产生与完全微调模型相当的结果。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue7feec5c\" id=\"ue7feec5c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc783546d\" id=\"uc783546d\">使用 PEFT 训练的 adapters 通常比完整模型小一个数量级，使其方便共享、存储和加载。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u191e754e\" id=\"u191e754e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9d923261\" id=\"u9d923261\">与完整尺寸的模型权重（约为 700MB）相比，存储在 Hub 上的 OPTForCausalLM 模型的 adapter 权重仅为~ 6MB。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u534cbdd8\" id=\"u534cbdd8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9bd330d4\" id=\"u9bd330d4\">如果您对学习更多关于</span><span data-lake-id=\"u8bb76144\" id=\"u8bb76144\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u982bedb9\" id=\"u982bedb9\"> PEFT 库感兴趣，请查看</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/peft/index\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u67df2262\" id=\"u67df2262\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5d10f9cf\" id=\"u5d10f9cf\">文档</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u07874054\" id=\"u07874054\">。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"d80k5\" id=\"d80k5\"><a href=\"#设置\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ub71c9944\" id=\"ub71c9944\"></a><span data-lake-id=\"u2a5b00b6\" id=\"u2a5b00b6\">设置</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u00bb535c\" id=\"u00bb535c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua2be6737\" id=\"ua2be6737\">首先安装 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u1a0ab42c\" id=\"u1a0ab42c\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u8e360118\" id=\"u8e360118\"> PEFT：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufedfb772\" id=\"ufedfb772\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufad20456\" id=\"ufad20456\">如果你想尝试全新的特性，你可能会有兴趣从源代码安装这个库：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pip%20install%20git%2Bhttps%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhuggingface%2Fpeft.git%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zCa9H%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"OQQW2\" id=\"OQQW2\"><a href=\"#支持的-peft-模型\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ub968fd01\" id=\"ub968fd01\"></a><span data-lake-id=\"ud94df857\" id=\"ud94df857\">支持的 PEFT 模型</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u981b6832\" id=\"u981b6832\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3eb70659\" id=\"u3eb70659\">Transformers 原生支持一些 PEFT 方法，这意味着你可以加载本地存储或在 Hub 上的 adapter 权重，并使用几行代码轻松运行或训练它们。以下是受支持的方法：</span></p><ul list=\"u43fb1ee2\"><li fid=\"u2913b85f\" data-lake-id=\"u789119fa\" id=\"u789119fa\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/peft/conceptual_guides/lora\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u7fca36c4\" id=\"u7fca36c4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u06258784\" id=\"u06258784\">Low Rank Adapters</span></a></li><li fid=\"u2913b85f\" data-lake-id=\"u125bdcc8\" id=\"u125bdcc8\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/peft/conceptual_guides/ia3\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u0228f5a6\" id=\"u0228f5a6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u44b0bd1d\" id=\"u44b0bd1d\">IA3</span></a></li><li fid=\"u2913b85f\" data-lake-id=\"u3a2ca619\" id=\"u3a2ca619\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.10512\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uba441279\" id=\"uba441279\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5c3726b3\" id=\"u5c3726b3\">AdaLoRA</span></a></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u97a40edd\" id=\"u97a40edd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua52441a6\" id=\"ua52441a6\">如果你想使用其他 PEFT 方法，例如提示学习或提示微调，或者关于通用的 </span><span data-lake-id=\"uec2fdcc8\" id=\"uec2fdcc8\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u64575c25\" id=\"u64575c25\"> PEFT 库，请参阅</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/peft/index\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u569d2a25\" id=\"u569d2a25\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1602854f\" id=\"u1602854f\">文档</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u5a240460\" id=\"u5a240460\">。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"NH7ZG\" id=\"NH7ZG\"><a href=\"#加载-peft-adapter\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u6c0497d5\" id=\"u6c0497d5\"></a><span data-lake-id=\"u75641df1\" id=\"u75641df1\">加载 PEFT adapter</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ueb29b41b\" id=\"ueb29b41b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub7ae87cf\" id=\"ub7ae87cf\">要从 huggingface 的 Transformers 库中加载并使用 PEFTadapter 模型，请确保 Hub 仓库或本地目录包含一个</span><code data-lake-id=\"u716a872a\" id=\"u716a872a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u77ca9592\" id=\"u77ca9592\">adapter_config.json</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3098bd8d\" id=\"u3098bd8d\">文件和 adapter 权重，如上例所示。然后，您可以使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u01903dc0\" id=\"u01903dc0\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf1add7da\" id=\"uf1add7da\">AutoModelFor</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1268caa4\" id=\"u1268caa4\">类加载 PEFT adapter 模型。例如，要为因果语言建模加载一个 PEFT adapter 模型：</span></p><ol list=\"ub67d2def\"><li fid=\"u2223a204\" data-lake-id=\"uc17f2941\" id=\"uc17f2941\"><span data-lake-id=\"uafe521f0\" id=\"uafe521f0\">指定 PEFT 模型 id</span></li><li fid=\"u2223a204\" data-lake-id=\"uc2ea706d\" id=\"uc2ea706d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b5139b1\" id=\"u9b5139b1\">将其传递给</span><code data-lake-id=\"u09a72070\" id=\"u09a72070\"><span data-lake-id=\"u37dbbea5\" id=\"u37dbbea5\">AutoModelForCausalLM</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2bee5233\" id=\"u2bee5233\">类</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20AutoModelForCausalLM%2C%20AutoTokenizer%5Cn%5Cnpeft_model_id%20%3D%20%5C%22ybelkada%2Fopt-350m-lora%5C%22%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(peft_model_id)%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KtdCh%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u1b8fb109\" id=\"u1b8fb109\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7572dc6d\" id=\"u7572dc6d\">你可以使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u01b82aec\" id=\"u01b82aec\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua2714de3\" id=\"ua2714de3\">AutoModelFor</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucd6fa8d3\" id=\"ucd6fa8d3\">类或基础模型类（如</span><code data-lake-id=\"uc482a4fd\" id=\"uc482a4fd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u671e51c9\" id=\"u671e51c9\">OPTForCausalLM</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2379f47a\" id=\"u2379f47a\">或</span><code data-lake-id=\"u859fdf94\" id=\"u859fdf94\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufc0db30f\" id=\"ufc0db30f\">LlamaForCausalLM</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua9db02e9\" id=\"ua9db02e9\">）来加载一个 PEFT adapter。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc51aa3bf\" id=\"uc51aa3bf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u72bb7f79\" id=\"u72bb7f79\">您也可以通过</span><code data-lake-id=\"uf1b107c5\" id=\"uf1b107c5\"><span data-lake-id=\"uad3ced00\" id=\"uad3ced00\">load_adapter</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0f4356f5\" id=\"u0f4356f5\">方法来加载 PEFT adapter。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20AutoModelForCausalLM%2C%20AutoTokenizer%5Cn%5Cnmodel_id%20%3D%20%5C%22facebook%2Fopt-350m%5C%22%5Cnpeft_model_id%20%3D%20%5C%22ybelkada%2Fopt-350m-lora%5C%22%5Cn%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(model_id)%5Cnmodel.load_adapter(peft_model_id)%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vsewZ%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"OHDfK\" id=\"OHDfK\"><a href=\"#基于8bit或4bit进行加载\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u79bedf84\" id=\"u79bedf84\"></a><span data-lake-id=\"u6b4abb5e\" id=\"u6b4abb5e\">基于 8bit 或 4bit 进行加载</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u9ac540ca\" id=\"u9ac540ca\"><code data-lake-id=\"ud4f98ee2\" id=\"ud4f98ee2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub25840f5\" id=\"ub25840f5\">bitsandbytes</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud4e57fc4\" id=\"ud4e57fc4\">集成支持 8bit 和 4bit 精度数据类型，这对于加载大模型非常有用，因为它可以节省内存（请参阅</span><code data-lake-id=\"u688b1690\" id=\"u688b1690\"><span data-lake-id=\"uca20e2b4\" id=\"uca20e2b4\">bitsandbytes</span></code><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/zh/quantization#bitsandbytes-integration\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u0c41de37\" id=\"u0c41de37\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4d4f0cfd\" id=\"u4d4f0cfd\">指南</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u73b73afa\" id=\"u73b73afa\">以了解更多信息）。要有效地将模型分配到您的硬件，请在 </span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/v4.51.3/zh/main_classes/model#transformers.PreTrainedModel.from_pretrained\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ud37c12e9\" id=\"ud37c12e9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u739f1429\" id=\"u739f1429\">from_pretrained()</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u97edbad8\" id=\"u97edbad8\"> 中添加</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8a6c6918\" id=\"u8a6c6918\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud4e7185d\" id=\"ud4e7185d\">load_in_8bit</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub6d11a06\" id=\"ub6d11a06\">或</span><code data-lake-id=\"uc8bf8380\" id=\"uc8bf8380\"><span data-lake-id=\"u41cc2231\" id=\"u41cc2231\">load_in_4bit</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub0f5d920\" id=\"ub0f5d920\">参数，并将</span><code data-lake-id=\"u17194a82\" id=\"u17194a82\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf56770b1\" id=\"uf56770b1\">device_map=&quot;auto&quot;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u944db5e9\" id=\"u944db5e9\">设置为：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20AutoModelForCausalLM%2C%20AutoTokenizer%2C%20BitsAndBytesConfig%5Cn%5Cnpeft_model_id%20%3D%20%5C%22ybelkada%2Fopt-350m-lora%5C%22%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(peft_model_id%2C%20quantization_config%3DBitsAndBytesConfig(load_in_8bit%3DTrue))%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XpLwu%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"SBd94\" id=\"SBd94\"><a href=\"#添加新的adapter\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u0fec5aef\" id=\"u0fec5aef\"></a><span data-lake-id=\"uf1f2b5db\" id=\"uf1f2b5db\">添加新的 adapter</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"udf7bf98a\" id=\"udf7bf98a\"><span data-lake-id=\"uec1e3b0f\" id=\"uec1e3b0f\">你可以使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"ubf2bc861\" id=\"ubf2bc861\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6a2de8f4\" id=\"u6a2de8f4\">~peft.PeftModel.add_adapter</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5998a8e7\" id=\"u5998a8e7\">方法为一个已有 adapter 的模型添加一个新的 adapter，只要新 adapter 的类型与当前 adapter 相同即可。例如，如果你有一个附加到模型上的 LoRA adapter：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20AutoModelForCausalLM%2C%20OPTForCausalLM%2C%20AutoTokenizer%5Cnfrom%20peft%20import%20PeftConfig%5Cn%5Cnmodel_id%20%3D%20%5C%22facebook%2Fopt-350m%5C%22%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(model_id)%5Cn%5Cnlora_config%20%3D%20LoraConfig(%5Cn%20%20%20%20target_modules%3D%5B%5C%22q_proj%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22k_proj%5C%22%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20init_lora_weights%3DFalse%5Cn)%5Cn%5Cnmodel.add_adapter(lora_config%2C%20adapter_)%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2bWW%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ucda5a8b7\" id=\"ucda5a8b7\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc20025a7\" id=\"uc20025a7\">添加一个新的 adapter：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22model.add_adapter(lora_config%2C%20adapter_)%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22agKQh%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u5df46fd9\" id=\"u5df46fd9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4b180c20\" id=\"u4b180c20\">现在您可以使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u70c272d8\" id=\"u70c272d8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3ec230dc\" id=\"u3ec230dc\">~peft.PeftModel.set_adapter</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u92bf6d8c\" id=\"u92bf6d8c\">来设置要使用的 adapter。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22model.set_adapter(%5C%22adapter_1%5C%22)%5Cnoutput%20%3D%20model.generate(**inputs)%5Cnprint(tokenizer.decode(output_disabled%5B0%5D%2C%20skip_special_tokens%3DTrue))%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnmodel.set_adapter(%5C%22adapter_2%5C%22)%5Cnoutput_enabled%20%3D%20model.generate(**inputs)%5Cnprint(tokenizer.decode(output_enabled%5B0%5D%2C%20skip_special_tokens%3DTrue))%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kNBjV%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"spuIl\" id=\"spuIl\"><a href=\"#启用和禁用adapters\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ucbf30919\" id=\"ucbf30919\"></a><span data-lake-id=\"u721c65c7\" id=\"u721c65c7\">启用和禁用 adapters</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u72f4177e\" id=\"u72f4177e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua208be85\" id=\"ua208be85\">一旦您将 adapter 添加到模型中，您可以启用或禁用 adapter 模块。要启用 adapter 模块：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20AutoModelForCausalLM%2C%20OPTForCausalLM%2C%20AutoTokenizer%5Cnfrom%20peft%20import%20PeftConfig%5Cn%5Cnmodel_id%20%3D%20%5C%22facebook%2Fopt-350m%5C%22%5Cnadapter_model_id%20%3D%20%5C%22ybelkada%2Fopt-350m-lora%5C%22%5Cntokenizer%20%3D%20AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_id)%5Cntext%20%3D%20%5C%22Hello%5C%22%5Cninputs%20%3D%20tokenizer(text%2C%20return_tensors%3D%5C%22pt%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(model_id)%5Cnpeft_config%20%3D%20PeftConfig.from_pretrained(adapter_model_id)%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnpeft_config.init_lora_weights%20%3D%20False%5Cn%5Cnmodel.add_adapter(peft_config)%5Cnmodel.enable_adapters()%5Cnoutput%20%3D%20model.generate(**inputs)%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uOjHs%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u21de62cc\" id=\"u21de62cc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u655f403a\" id=\"u655f403a\">要禁用 adapter 模块：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22model.disable_adapters()%5Cnoutput%20%3D%20model.generate(**inputs)%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SZBj9%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"FJJZT\" id=\"FJJZT\"><a href=\"#训练一个-peft-adapter\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u500b4bb7\" id=\"u500b4bb7\"></a><span data-lake-id=\"uc3cf3d5b\" id=\"uc3cf3d5b\">训练一个 PEFT adapter</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u07438487\" id=\"u07438487\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubd4ed4f4\" id=\"ubd4ed4f4\">PEFT 适配器受</span><code data-lake-id=\"uc1325164\" id=\"uc1325164\"><span data-lake-id=\"u33df85fb\" id=\"u33df85fb\">Trainer</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2b4c6805\" id=\"u2b4c6805\">类支持，因此您可以为您的特定用例训练适配器。它只需要添加几行代码即可。例如，要训练一个 LoRA adapter：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufcb42ed9\" id=\"ufcb42ed9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u688d7acb\" id=\"u688d7acb\">如果你不熟悉如何使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"uea26159b\" id=\"uea26159b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b03c99d\" id=\"u9b03c99d\">Trainer</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud3715370\" id=\"ud3715370\">微调模型，请查看</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/zh/training\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u4b47abb4\" id=\"u4b47abb4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua3088c06\" id=\"ua3088c06\">微调预训练模型</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u302f32fb\" id=\"u302f32fb\">教程。</span></p><ol list=\"u66dd25ae\"><li fid=\"u3d314e79\" data-lake-id=\"u40c9086b\" id=\"u40c9086b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubff66b79\" id=\"ubff66b79\">使用任务类型和超参数定义 adapter 配置（参见</span><code data-lake-id=\"u547443ec\" id=\"u547443ec\"><span data-lake-id=\"u492cd31a\" id=\"u492cd31a\">~peft.LoraConfig</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2a17caa4\" id=\"u2a17caa4\">以了解超参数的详细信息）。</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20peft%20import%20LoraConfig%5Cn%5Cnpeft_config%20%3D%20LoraConfig(%5Cn%20%20%20%20lora_alpha%3D16%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20lora_dropout%3D0.1%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20r%3D64%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20bias%3D%5C%22none%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20task_type%3D%5C%22CAUSAL_LM%5C%22%2C%5Cn)%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IH9ff%22%7D\"></card><ol list=\"u87e1e2fb\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"uc99d49cd\" data-lake-id=\"u81131ede\" id=\"u81131ede\"><span data-lake-id=\"uadc763fd\" id=\"uadc763fd\">将 adapter 添加到模型中。</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22model.add_adapter(peft_config)%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O28iV%22%7D\"></card><ol list=\"u5f7e0783\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"ud1d7bf65\" data-lake-id=\"u8948c63e\" id=\"u8948c63e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u89fe8a3a\" id=\"u89fe8a3a\">现在可以将模型传递给</span><code data-lake-id=\"u3a8d5483\" id=\"u3a8d5483\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua07ecf8a\" id=\"ua07ecf8a\">Trainer</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u05dfe763\" id=\"u05dfe763\">了！</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22trainer%20%3D%20Trainer(model%3Dmodel%2C%20...)%5Cntrainer.train()%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QpGmw%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud9e6e136\" id=\"ud9e6e136\"><span data-lake-id=\"u686e9554\" id=\"u686e9554\">要保存训练好的 adapter 并重新加载它：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22model.save_pretrained(save_dir)%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(save_dir)%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QeX1v%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud33d25df\" id=\"ud33d25df\"><br></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 1043, "description": "示例代码📎peft-demo.ppt注：将ppt后缀名改为zip后解压参数高效微调（PEFT）方法在微调过程中冻结预训练模型的参数，并在其顶部添加少量可训练参数（adapters）。adapters 被训练以学习特定任务的信息。这种方法已被证明非常节省内存，同时具有较低的计算使用量，同时产生...", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T02:00:25.000Z", "created_at": "2025-04-28T01:37:37.000Z", "id": 217435890, "status": 1}